    <p>Global Alumni is writing to inform you that on July 31, 2026, a phis=
hing email was sent from the address <a href=3D"mailto:noreply@globalalumni=
.org">noreply@globalalumni.org</a> with the subject line &quot;AI models ar=
e being weaponized against crypto holders.&quot;This email was not sent by =
us or any of our affiliates. Global Alumni is working alongside external ad=
visors and cybersecurity experts to investigate this activity. If you recei=
ved this email, please delete it and do not open it and do not click on the=
 link contained therein. If you have already interacted with the email, ple=
ase take the steps outlined below:

    <br>

    <ol style=3D"text-align: left; width: 80%;">
    <li>Change the password for any account that you entered after clicking=
 the link.</li>=20
    <li>Change the password for any accounts that were logged in at the tim=
e you clicked on the link. </li>
    <li>Change credentials for any accounts where the same or similar passw=
ord is used.</li>
    <li>Enable multi-factor authentication (MFA) on any accounts where it i=
s not already active.</li>
    <li>Notify your IT/Information Security team so they can conduct approp=
riate monitoring for suspicious activity on your network.</li>
    </ol>
    </p>

    <p>
    As a reminder, Global Alumni will never request that you share sensitiv=
e login credentials, account details, or personal information via unsolicit=
ed email. It is common for the groups behind cyberattacks to attempt to exp=
loit individuals by creating a sense of urgency. Please exercise caution an=
d do not click on links or open attachments from unrecognized senders.
    </p>
    <p>
    Global Alumni takes the security of your information seriously and we s=
incerely apologize for any concern this may cause. If you have any question=
s about this matter, please contact <a href=3D"mailto:attention@globalalumn=
i.org">attention@globalalumni.org</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
    Sincerely,<br>
    Ivan Reyes<br>
    Manager, Technology, Global Alumni.
    </p>
